99802600839_6310123389154292449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0w82gQDrN4QQ7kNvwFMPb9j&_nc_oc=AdpgO3-aw8Js4rqlapbui43c3Z92b-mtviELNRvLwis-IIV4cQ-N0A7VPsgWqxJ40XU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO0pnkkxOkssBeCNvkI-fvl-l9IaFDkT4dUx8Cm_ct04g&oe=6AC5122A"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1408451007385177", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1408451010718510_6507093242778030274_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_cPnMPELg1IQ7kNvwHh4Dxu&_nc_oc=AdovXRmK3tLsWQ27ZXmbqH5cAEeJHBRvC4GTrpzmQNZ_K0l5B_-wOpocn7_nME4rRTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMz0GrUyjEX9PNGyjmxsgHbib9T_7xB5NU66fmawVH0Jg&oe=6AC52702"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1386407943645541", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_1386407946978874_7967818282152413405_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_YmOBkbt4dQQ7kNvwFkC9Ek&_nc_oc=Adq_qTFxd7HjUwZ2SvSVb8tZQhpZ9yhDqqUYQl9dm49LZLWH7QCVK89pAA8vOBrHJSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNKVfrQxh3CDSQ7CQqVggE2WSHi_XubTFTyzYgytVtupA&oe=6AC504FB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_V8_Landscape.png", "id": "4187032411551185", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_4187032414884518_6684493733824043119_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ow9fblJxEN0Q7kNvwFVD9St&_nc_oc=AdolEXuI7LWjhv8vsAuYg2XmUowYVrwPpolSiuF74Gl1wpjVHTYxfP9ZjURX--k11d8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPMuiIOvmdPx--r-FMK5WgqEOX0rkroJcPXQXgqulbxtQ&oe=6AC4FFAD"}, "display_name": "VAIL", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "multiplayer", "social", "extraction"], "long_description": "The highest-rated VR shooter is FREE. VAIL delivers precision-crafted gunplay, 10+ competitive modes, and a massive free Extraction island. \nCustomize your gear, squad up, and see why VAIL has 4.8 stars across 67K reviews.\n\n{1419076756672610}\n\n\n#  **TRAINING GROUNDS (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nJump in with nothing. Random maps, weapon pickups, and loadout modifiers designed to get you into real gunfights fast. To know what VAIL's gunplay actually feels like in your hands.\n\n{826869113772460}\n{1861007317926953}\n\n#  **EXTRACTION (FREE EARLY ACCESS)**\nDescend into the depths of Reyn. Extract encrypted data, technology, and resources while autonomous drones guard every corridor like archangels. A free, high-stakes mode that rewards patience, precision, and knowing when to run.\n\n{2038611673568486}\n{906663608919767}\n\n\n#  **SOCIAL HUB (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nVAIL's Social Hub is the center of gravity. Hang out, shoot, Challenge players to 1v1s, or mine ORE shards from the quarry to unlock rewards.\n\n{911511758042190}\n\n\n\n#  **VAIL COMBAT (UNLOCKABLE)**\n\nThis is what VAIL was built for. Team Deathmatch, Seek and Destroy, Free for All, and 10+ more modes. Full progression, 8 prestiges, leaderboards, stats, competitive, and the complete weapon and cosmetics system. Upgrade once, play forever.\n\n{1220581586247000}\n{1547957886294186}\n\n\n\n# **CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED**\nVR Game of the Year Finalist - VR Awards 2022 / People's Voice: Best VR Game - Webby Awards 2024 / Best Social/Interactive - VRDB Community Choice Awards 2024\nVoted by the community. Verified by 67,000+ reviews. 4.8 stars on the Quest store.\n\n{988770307650678}\n\nJoin the community!\nDiscord.gg/VAILVR\n\n{875677118774648}\n\n", "short_description": "The highest-rated VR shooter is FREE. VAIL delivers precision-crafted gunplay, 10+ competitive modes, and a massive free Extraction island. \nCustomize your gear, squad up, and see why VAIL has 4.8 stars across 67K reviews."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aexlab.com/aexlab/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AEXLAB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vailvr.com/", "category": "